  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SevenMinutes.Puzzles.ReadableObject
  prompt: Gazeteyi Oku
  title: "G\xDCNL\xDCK HABER \u2014 14 MART 2011"
  body: "D\xD6RT K\u0130\u015E\u0130L\u0130K A\u0130LE \u0130Z BIRAKMADAN KAYBOLDU\n\nPolis evi i\xE7eriden kilitli buldu. Evdeki b\xFCt\xFCn saatler tam olarak saati be\u015F ge\xE7e durmu\u015Ftu.\n\nKom\u015Fular, maskeli bir adam\u0131n geceleri eve 'garip makineler' ta\u015F\u0131d\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 g\xF6rd\xFCklerini s\xF6yl\xFCyor."
  isClue: 0
