  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SevenMinutes.Puzzles.ReadableObject
  prompt: "\u0130\u015F \u0130stasyonunu Kullan"
  title: "UNIT-7 BAKIM TERM\u0130NAL\u0130"
  body: "PROJE UNIT-7 \u2014 DURUM: KONTROLDEN \xC7IKTI\n\nUNIT-6 \xC7IKI\u015E PROTOKOL\xDC:\n  \u2022 UNIT-6 bir yapay zek\xE2d\u0131r. Ziyaret\xE7iye G\xDCVEN TEST\u0130 uygular.\n  \u2022 G\xFCven %60'a ula\u015F\u0131rsa iki say\u0131l\u0131k kap\u0131 kodunu verir.\n  \u2022 Kod, kap\u0131n\u0131n yan\u0131ndaki konsola girilir.\n  \u2022 Not: UNIT-6 yalan\u0131 ve kabal\u0131\u011F\u0131 sezer. D\xFCr\xFCst ol.\n\nUYARI: kap\u0131 bek\xE7isi UNIT-6 yaln\u0131zca \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015F\u0131n yan\u0131ndaki a\u011F\u0131r plakaya bas\u0131l\u0131 tutulurken g\xFC\xE7 al\u0131r.\nBunu sadece UNIT-7 kadar a\u011F\u0131r bir \xFCnite yapabilir."
  isClue: 1
