  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SevenMinutes.Puzzles.ReadableObject
  prompt: "Garip Nesneyi \u0130ncele"
  title: Prototip bir kafa
  body: "Eski bir robot kafas\u0131 \u2014 t\u0131pk\u0131 UNIT-7'ninki gibi.\nAlt\u0131na kaz\u0131nm\u0131\u015F:\n\n\"UNIT-6. Kap\u0131y\u0131 korumak i\xE7in yap\u0131ld\u0131.\nA\xE7mak i\xE7in de\u011Fil.\"\n\nYan\u0131nda el yaz\u0131s\u0131yla bir etiket: \"UNIT-7 hissetmeyi \xF6\u011Freniyor. Onlara yard\u0131m etmeden \xF6nce kapat\u0131n.\""
  isClue: 0
